//============================================================================================================================================
//                                                             ENGINE.SYMBOLINDEX
//============================================================================================================================================
// 🧩 Root symbol index — every source folder in Engine, one line each.

%format    symbolindex 1.0
%scope     root
%path      Engine
%layers    8
%folders   221
%symbols   4110
%protocol  root → layer → folder; never open a source file the folder index already answers

//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                                                      APPLICATION
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

I Source | Application | Engine/Application/ConsoleHost/Source/Source.symbolindex | 1 src | 25 sym | Headless bring-up in link order — every unit constructed, reported, and reclaimed without a window.
I Source | Application | Engine/Application/EditorHost/Source/Source.symbolindex  | 1 src | 1 sym  | The combined editor — the same tree, the same tick, and a roster whose length is the only thing that separates it from PaintHost.
I Source | Application | Engine/Application/PaintHost/Source/Source.symbolindex   | 1 src | 1 sym  | The standalone painting executable — one roster entry, the documents it presents against, and no engine logic at all.

//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                                                        CONTRACT
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

I Contract | Contract | Engine/Contract/Contract.symbolindex | 6 src | 84 sym | The five combination behaviours `22` §3 declares — read by impressions, by layer entries and by cell content alike.

//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//                                                         SHARED
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

I Shared | Shared | Engine/Shared/Shared.symbolindex | 15 src | 140 sym | The count-derived weight, the four rejection tests, and the saturating ceiling that keeps a still workspace responsive.

